<includeonly>{{#invoke:Map|marker}}</includeonly><noinclude>
One marker on a Map. Position is a percentage of the picture: x from the left, y from the top. Logged-in editors can click the target button on any map to get this code for the spot they click.

<pre>
{{Map marker|chest|52.5|51.5}}
{{Map marker|boss|7|12.5|name=Ogre King|text=Drops the Ogre Club.|link=Ogre King}}
</pre>

Part of the [[Project:Design kit|design kit]]. Marker types are listed in [[Module:Map/types]].

